# Datasets. TRAIL is gated and must not be reshared outside a gated or
# private repository, so downloaded traces stay local.
#
# Anchored to the repository root on purpose. Unanchored, this pattern matches
# every directory named `data` at any depth, which silently excluded
# `src/afb/data/` — the taxonomy and the TRAIL mappings, which the judge prompt
# is built from and which principles 2 and 4 require to be versioned.
/data/

# Judge output and analysis artifacts
results/
